Do you remember the wonderful adventure game Stasis, which touched the soul and told of the most tragic and bleak events in space? Now, the developers at The Brotherhood intend to tell us a new story, set in the distant future in an African setting. The game's protagonist ends up there completely by accident and becomes the epicenter of a rather unfortunate turn of events. For now, that's all we know about the project; the studio itself plans to launch a crowdfunding campaign soon and is confident of its success. After their first space masterpiece, there's no reason not to trust the company.

In terms of appearance, Beautiful Desolation will be the same isometric gameplay as Stasis, with point-and-click controls. All that's left is to wait for the game's release, and then you can download Beautiful Desolation for free via torrent.

